    <briefdescription>
<para>Called when an enchanting table prepares offers for an item. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Set an offer to std::nullopt to hide it, or assign a new <ref refid="classendstone_1_1EnchantmentOffer" kindref="compound">EnchantmentOffer</ref> to replace it. Each offer contains every enchantment that Bedrock applies when its corresponding button is selected.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This event can be called multiple times while the enchanting table is open. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Cancelling the event removes all enchanting offers. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
